---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Easy Todo List"
  description="Learn about Easy Todo List, the simple and free online todo list app. No signup required—create and manage your tasks directly in your browser."
  canonicalUrl="https://easytodolist.com/about"
>
  <div class="bg-canvas-soft py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink font-semibold mb-4">About Easy Todo List</h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Productivity shouldn't be complicated. We built the simplest way to manage your tasks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-body space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Easy Todo List was born from a simple frustration: most task management tools are overcomplicated. They require accounts, sync services, subscriptions, and tutorials just to add "Buy milk" to a list.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe a todo list should be <strong>easy</strong>. Open the website, add your tasks, and get things done. That's it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Why We Exist</h2>
        <p>
          Every major productivity app tries to be everything: Kanban boards, Gantt charts, team collaboration, time tracking, AI suggestions. The result? A tool that's harder to use than a spreadsheet.
        </p>
        <p>
          We took the opposite approach. Easy Todo List does one thing—managing personal tasks—and does it extremely well. No learning curve, no configuration, no account required.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">How It Works</h2>
        <p>
          Our todo list runs entirely in your browser. Your tasks are stored locally on your device, giving you:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Your data never leaves your device unless you choose to share it</li>
          <li><strong>Speed:</strong> No server delays—everything happens instantly</li>
          <li><strong>Reliability:</strong> No accounts to hack, no servers to go down</li>
          <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> No sync conflicts, no version issues, no subscriptions</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Features That Matter</h2>
        <p>
          We focused on the features that actually help you get things done:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4" style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1rem;">
          <li><strong>Instant access:</strong> No signup, no waiting—just open and go</li>
          <li><strong>Categorize:</strong> Organize tasks into meaningful groups</li>
          <li><strong>Quick add:</strong> Add multiple tasks at once by pasting a list</li>
          <li><strong>Share lists:</strong> Send someone a read-only link to your list</li>
          <li><strong>Templates:</strong> Start fast with pre-made list structures</li>
          <li><strong>Dark mode:</strong> Easy on the eyes for night owls</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Our Values</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Simplicity First:</strong> Every feature we add must not complicate the experience. If it requires explanation, we reconsider.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Privacy by Design:</strong> We don't want your data. Your tasks are yours—and we built the product to prove it.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Free Forever:</strong> No ads, no premium tier, no paywall for basic features. Everyone deserves a simple todo list.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Get Started</h2>
        <p>
          Ready to simplify your task management? Head to the <a href="/app" class="text-link hover:border-b border-link">app</a> and create your first list. No account needed.
        </p>
        <p>
          Or explore our <a href="/templates" class="text-link hover:border-b border-link">templates</a> for common task lists like daily routines, shopping lists, and project trackers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline text-center">
        <p class="text-body mb-4">Questions? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-6 text-button-md font-[500] text-ink bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-full hover:border-hairline-strong transition-all"
        >
          Get in Touch →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>